<title>UK: Guinness says stg to hold back '97 progress.</title>
<headline>Guinness says stg to hold back '97 progress.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Plc said on Thursday that the strength of the pound will limit its progress in 1997.</p>
</text>
